        <activityName xml:lang="en">Basic oxygen furnace slag, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Basic oxygen furnace slag, at plant
BOF slag is produced as a by-product. According to Remus (2013) 0.125 kg/kg LS of BOF slag is produced and 0.012 kg /kgLS of slag is produced from secondary metallurgy - assumed to be composed and used / disposed as BOF slag. 89% of total slag amount is reused, 11% is landfiled. Economic allocation factor is 0.0077.;
Synonyms: In UVEK2018 enthalten; 
UUID: f7790ca6-bab4-3853-a412-fea64f11be1d
&lt;null&gt;
Location: Data from literature, referring to Europe
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Sampling procedure: Data from literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f7790ca6-bab4-3853-a412-fea64f11be1d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
